              "settings": {
                "content": "\u003cp\u003eEvery children's soccer kit at Mudjean is an \u003cstrong\u003eauthentic, original MUDJEAN design\u003c/strong\u003e. They are creative expressions inspired by the rich culture and passion surrounding international soccer, designed for fans who wish to celebrate their favorite teams and the spirit of the game.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c/strong\u003e These products are not official, licensed merchandise and are not licensed, sponsored, or endorsed by any official football association, national team, club, or other rights holder. Mudjean is an independent brand with no official affiliation to these entities.\u003c/p\u003e",
